       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SKWMUPDT.
       AUTHOR.         DAVID A. PLUM, JR.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   MAY 1985 / DATE CONVERTED   APR 1994.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.

      **************************************************************
      *D  S K W M U P D T    KEYWORD/MODIFIER UPDATE SUBPROGRAM    *
      *                                                            *
      *   THIS SUBPROGRAM IS CALLED BY:                            *
      *       1) TDSCMAIN                                          *
      *                                                            *
      *   SUBPROGRAMS CALLED:                                      *
      *       1) TBLOWUP  - BLOWUP SUBPROGRAM                      *
      *       2) CRFMTKWM - REFORMAT KEYWORD/MODIFIER SUBPROGRAM   *
      *       3) TSCRPRT2 - SCREEN PRINT SUBPROGRAM                *
      *       4) CCODECHK - CODE CHECK SUBPROGRAM                  *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *D                                                           *
      *D  THIS SUBPROGRAM PERFORMS THE FOLLOWING FUNCTIONS:        *
      *D      1) LOADING OF KEYWORD/MODIFIERS INTO THE DATA BASE   *
      *D      2) DELETING KEYWORD/MODIFIERS FROM THE DATA BASE     *
      *D         (PERMITTED ONLY WHEN THE KEYWORD/MODIFIER IS NOT  *
      *D         LINKED TO ANY CODES)                              *
      *D      3) MODIFICATION OF KEYWORD/MODIFIERS THAT ARE        *
      *D         PRESENT IN THE DATA BASE (EXCEPT THOSE            *
      *D         KEYWORD/MODIFIERS THAT ARE LINKED TO CORPORATE    *
      *D         CODES AS THE CORPORATE KWM - SEE SDSCMAIN.DOC)    *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *C PROGRAM MODIFICATIONS:                                    *
      *C                                                           *
      *C 08/06/85 DATA BASE LOGGING CALLS WERE ADDED TO THIS       *
      *C          PROGRAM.      D.A. PLUM                          *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  09/19/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
      *C            CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
      *C            LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
      *C            ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
      *C                                        -T W COTTON        *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  09/26/85  REPLACED CALLS TO THE SUBPROGRAM TRSTRKWM      *
      *C            WITH CALLS TO TRFMTKWM.  KEYWORDS AND          *
      *C            ARE NO LONGER LIMITED TO ONLY 3 WORDS.         *
      *C                                 D.A. PLUM                 *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  10/10/85  REVISED LOGIC WITHIN THE "MODIFY KWM FUNCTION" *
      *C            TO ACCOUNT THE USE OF THE DATASET DDESC2.      *
      *C            WHEN MODIFYING A KWM, AFTER REVISING AN ENTRY  *
      *C            IN DCODE IT IS NECESSARY TO MODIFY THE "00"    *
      *C            RECORD OF EITHER DDESC OR DDESC2 FOR THE CODE. *
      *C                                 D.A. PLUM                 *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  01/15/86  REVISED LOGIC WITHIN THE "MODIFY KWM FUNCTION" *
      *C            SO THAT KEYWORD/MODIFERS LINKED TO CORPORATE   *
      *C            CODES AS THE CORPORATE KWM ARE NEVER CHANGED.  *
      *C            WHETHER OR NOT A CODE IS A CORPORATE CODE IS   *
      *C            DETERMINED BY BOTH THE PLANT CODE AND THE      *
      *C            FORMAT OF THE CODE ITSELF.  THE PLANT CODE IS  *
      *C            FOUND IN MPLTINFO AS IS AN ENTRY WHICH         *
      *C            IDENTIFIES WHERE THE CORPORATE (AMERICAN       *
      *C            LANGUAGE) DESCRIPTION IS STORED (DDESC OR      *
      *C            DDESC2).  THE DOCUMENTATION FILE FOR THIS      *
      *C            SUBSYSTEM (SDSCMAIN.DOC.CME) EXPLAINS THE      *
      *C            CONVENTIONS BEING FOLLOWED.                    *
      *C                                 D.A. PLUM                 *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  03/24/86 ADDED CALLS TO CCODECHK WHICH DETERMINES IF A   *
      *C           CODE IS A "CORPORATE" CODE OR A "PLANT" CODE.   *
      *C           ALSO ADDED MPLTINFO-PARMS AS A PARAMETER BEING  *
      *C           PASSED TO THIS SUBPROGRAM FROM TDSCMAIN.        *
      *C           CHANGED CALLS TO TRFMTKWM TO CRFMTKWM TO        *
      *C           REFLECT THE RECENT CHANGE IN NAMING CONVENTIONS.*
      *C                                 D.A. PLUM                 *
      *C                                                           *
      *C  04/22/94 CONVERTED THIS PROGRAM TO RUN ON THE AS/400.    *
      *C                                 C.R. KALMAN               *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDSCMAIN-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT DCODE-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DCODE-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DDESC-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DDESC2-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MKEYADJ-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MKEYADJ-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC    PIC X(1700).

       FD  DCODE-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCODE-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3400  OF MCFLCS3401.

       FD  DCODE-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCODE-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3400  OF MCFLCS3401.

       FD  DDESC-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1400  OF MCFLCS1401.

       FD  DDESC2-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC2-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3100  OF MCFLCS3101.

       FD  MKEYADJ-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MKEYADJ-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3300  OF MCFLCS3301.

       FD  MKEYADJ-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MKEYADJ-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3300  OF MCFLCS3301.

      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************

       77  PASSED-SPOOL-PRT              PIC S9(2) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
       77  CALC-ADDR                     PIC S9(9) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
       77  COUNT-UPDATES                 PIC S9(2) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
       77  MKEYADJ-DELETE-FLAG           PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
       77  EOF-DCODE                     PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-AREA.
           05  SAVE-VIEW-STATUS       PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  SAVE-CHAIN-LENGTH      PIC S9(9) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  SAVE-ADDR              PIC S9(9) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  SAVE-CODE              PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND      PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-NEW-KWM           PIC X(50) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-OLD-KWM           PIC X(50) VALUE SPACES.

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                     DATA BASE AREA                       **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       COPY MKEYADJ OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DCODE   OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DDESC   OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DDESC2  OF COPYLIB.

       01  DSET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-NAME                 PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DSET-MKEYADJ              PIC X(16) VALUE "MKEYADJ;".
           05  DSET-DCODE                PIC X(16) VALUE "DCODE;".
           05  DSET-DDESC                PIC X(16) VALUE "DDESC;".
           05  DSET-DDESC2               PIC X(16) VALUE "DDESC2;".

       COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTAT  OF COPYLIB.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       01  SEARCH-ITEMS.
           05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
           05  CODE-SEARCH            PIC X(16) VALUE "CORP-CODE;".
           05  KWM-SEARCH             PIC X(16) VALUE "KEYWORD-ADJ;".

       01 ARG-VALUES.
           05  CODE-ARG               PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  KWM-ARG.
               10  KEY-ARG            PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
               10  MOD-ARG            PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05  ID-ARG                 PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  DB-LOG-VALUES.
           05 DB-LOG-TEXT             PIC X(8) VALUE "SKWMUPDT".
           05 DB-LOG-TEXT-LEN         PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE -8.

       COPY MULTLOCK OF COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                 VIEW COMMUNICATION AREA                  **
      **                                                          **
      **          ------ ALSO SEE LINKAGE SECTION ------          **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       01  FIELD-NUMBER               PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 1.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN             PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 76.
       01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN             PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 76.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT               PIC X(64) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                      PIC Z(11)9.
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                  TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       01  MENU-SCREEN.
           05  MENU-CMD-LINE           PIC X(79).
           05  MENU-MSG-LINE           PIC X(79).

       01  KWM-SCREEN.
           05  KEYWORD                PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MODIFIER               PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05  KWM-CMD-LINE           PIC X(79).
           05  KWM-MSG-LINE           PIC X(79).

       01  MOD-SCREEN.
           05  OLD-KWM.
               10  OLD-KEYWORD        PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
               10  OLD-MODIFIER       PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05  NEW-KWM.
               10  NEW-KEYWORD        PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
               10  NEW-MODIFIER       PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05  MOD-CMD-LINE           PIC X(79).
           05  MOD-MSG-LINE           PIC X(79).

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                  COMMUNICATIONS AREAS                    **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       COPY CATREAD  OF COPYLIB.

       COPY CRFMTKWM OF COPYLIB.

       COPY CCODECHK OF COPYLIB.

      ***** NOTE THAT "TSCRPRT2" ALSO USES PASSED-SPOOL-PRT, *****
      ***** VIEW-COMAREA, AND LANGUAGE-PARMS AS PARAMETERS   *****
      ***** IN ADDITION TO THOSE DEFINED BELOW.              *****

       01  TSCRPRT2-PARAMETERS.
           05  TSCRPRT2-PRINTCNTL        PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  TSCRPRT2-PAGECNTL         PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 49.
           05  TSCRPRT2-SPOOLSW          PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".

       01  TSCRPRT2-ERROR-SW             PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".

       01  TSCRPRT2-DISPLAY-AREA.
           05     FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  TSCRPRT2-MSG              PIC X(27).
           05     FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  TSCRPRT2-STAT             PIC S9(4).
           05     FILLER                 PIC X(2).
           05  TSCRPRT2-FLD              PIC X(14).
           05     FILLER                 PIC X(2).

       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DISPDATA OF COPYLIB.

       01  OFF-SWITCH                          PIC 1 VALUE B"0".
       01  ON-SWITCH                           PIC 1 VALUE B"1".

       01  IOFEEDBACK.
           05  IO-OFFSET                       PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-OUT-COUNT                    PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-GET-COUNT                    PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-PUT-GET-COUNT                PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-OTHER-COUNT                  PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  FILLER                          PIC X.
           05  IO-OPERATION                    PIC X.
           05  IO-FORMAT                       PIC X(10).
           05  IO-DEV-CLASS                    PIC X(2).
           05  IO-PGM-DEVICE                   PIC X(10).
           05  IO-REC-LEN                      PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RTG-DTA                      PIC X(80).
           05  IO-BLK-REC                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RESV                         PIC X(4).
           05  IO-BLK-CNT                      PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  FILLER                          PIC X(8).

           05  FEEDBACK-SIZE                   PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  JOIN-LOGICAL                    PIC X(4).
           05  KEY-OFFSET                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  LOCKED-RECORDS                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  MAX-FIELDS                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  FIELD-MAPPING-OFFSET            PIC S9(8) COMP-4.
           05  CURRENT-FILE-POSITION           PIC X(1).
           05  CURRENT-RECORD-DELETE           PIC X(1).
           05  NO-OF-KEYS                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  RESERVED-FIELD                  PIC X(4).
           05  KEY-LENGTH                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  DATA-MEMBER-NO                  PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
           05  IO-RECNUM                       PIC S9(8) COMP-4.

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **              L I N K A G E    S E C T I O N              **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                       PIC X(10).

      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                 VIEW COMMUNICATION AREA                  **
      **                                                          **
      **      ----- ALSO SEE WORKING-STORAGE SECTION -----        **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       COPY VCOMLINK OF COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB  OF COPYLIB.

       01  MPLTINFO-PARMS.
           05  MPLTINFO-PLANT-CODE       PIC X(3).
           05  MPLTINFO-DDESC-LANG       PIC X(3).
           05  MPLTINFO-DDESC2-LANG      PIC X(3).

      **************************************************************
      **##########################################################**
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N            **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **##########################################################**
      **************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  BASE,
                                 VIEW-COMAREA,
                                 LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                                 MPLTINFO-PARMS.

       KEYWORD-MODIFIER-SECTION.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "SKWMUPDT" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN INPUT      DCODE-I           MKEYADJ-I.
           OPEN I-O        DCODE-O           MKEYADJ-O
                           DDESC2-O          DDESC-O
                           DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE           DCODE-I           DCODE-O
                           MKEYADJ-I         MKEYADJ-O
                           DDESC-O           DDESC2-O
                           DISPLAY-FILE.

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *     6 - M A I N                                *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "KWMMENU" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-PUT-WINDOW.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO MENU-SCREEN.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE MENU-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO MENU-SCREEN.

       6-PERFORM-SELECTION.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
               PERFORM 61-ADD-KWM     THRU 61-ADD-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 2
               PERFORM 62-DELETE-KWM  THRU 62-DELETE-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
               PERFORM 63-MODIFY-KWM  THRU 63-MODIFY-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X
           ELSE
      *--------INVALID FUNCTION KEY
               MOVE   9 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  10 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MENU-CMD-LINE
               MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
               MOVE MENU-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
               PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************************************
      *                                                       *
      *         A D D   K E Y W O R D  M O D I F I E R        *
      *                                                       *
      *********************************************************

       61-ADD-KWM.
           MOVE "ADDKWM" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       61-PUT-WINDOW.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       61-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO KWM-SCREEN.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE KWM-SCREEN  TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO KWM-SCREEN.

       61-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               GO TO 61-ADD-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *-------INVALID FUNCTION KEY
              MOVE   9 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE  10 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-FIELD-EDITS.
           IF KEYWORD = SPACES
      *-------KEYWORD MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 11020 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98), IND (1)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.
           IF MODIFIER = SPACES
      *-------MODIFIER MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 13060 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-EDIT-KWM.
           MOVE KEYWORD  TO SEND-KW.
           MOVE MODIFIER TO SEND-MOD.

           CALL "CRFMTKWM" USING REFORMAT-KWM-AREA,
               BASE, VIEW-COMAREA.

           MOVE RETURN-KW  TO KEY-ARG.
           MOVE RETURN-MOD TO MOD-ARG.
           PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-I.

           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
      *-------KEYWORD/MODIFER ALREADY EXISTS
              MOVE  11 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE   8 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE  ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYADJ-KEYWORD-MOD.
           PERFORM 999-WRITE-MKEYADJ-O.

      *----KEYWORD/MODIFIER HAS BEEN ADDED.
           MOVE SPACES TO KWM-SCREEN.
           MOVE 11023 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE.
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98).
           MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN.
           GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-ADD-KWM-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************************************
      *                                                       *
      *     D E L E T E   K E Y W O R D   M O D I F I E R     *
      *                                                       *
      *********************************************************

       62-DELETE-KWM.
           MOVE "DELKWM" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       62-PUT-WINDOW.
           MOVE SPACES  TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       62-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO KWM-SCREEN.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE KWM-SCREEN  TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO KWM-SCREEN.

       62-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               GO TO 62-DELETE-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *--------INVALID FUNCTION KEY
               MOVE   9 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  10 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
               MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
               MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
               PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-FIELD-EDITS.
           IF KEYWORD = SPACES
      *-------KEYWORD MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 11020 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.
           IF MODIFIER = SPACES
      *-------MODIFIER MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 13060 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-EDIT-KWM.
           MOVE KEYWORD  TO SEND-KW.
           MOVE MODIFIER TO SEND-MOD.

           CALL "CRFMTKWM" USING REFORMAT-KWM-AREA,
               BASE, VIEW-COMAREA.

           MOVE RETURN-KW  TO KEY-ARG.
           MOVE RETURN-MOD TO MOD-ARG.
           PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-I.

           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *-------KEYWORD/MODIFIER DOES NOT EXIST
              MOVE  11 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE   4 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE  ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

           PERFORM 999-START-DCODE-I.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
      *-------CANNOT DELETE.  KEYWORD/MODIFIER IS LINKED TO
      *-------ONE OR MORE CODES.
              MOVE   3 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE  48 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE  ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM
           ELSE
              PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-O
              PERFORM 999-DELETE-MKEYADJ-O
      *-------KEYWORD/MODIFIER HAS BEEN DELETED
              MOVE SPACES TO KWM-SCREEN
              MOVE 11021 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO KWM-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
              MOVE KWM-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-DELETE-KWM-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************************************
      *                                                       *
      *     M O D I F Y   K E Y W O R D   M O D I F I E R     *
      *                                                       *
      *********************************************************

       63-MODIFY-KWM.
           MOVE "MODKWM" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       63-PUT-WINDOW.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       63-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES TO MOD-SCREEN.

       63-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE MOD-SCREEN  TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO MOD-SCREEN.

       63-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               GO TO 63-MODIFY-KWM-X
           ELSE
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *--------INVALID FUNCTION KEY
               MOVE   9 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  10 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
               MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
               MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
               PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

       63-FIELD-EDITS.
           IF OLD-KEYWORD  = SPACES
      *-------KEYWORD MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 11020 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (98)
              MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.
           IF OLD-MODIFIER = SPACES
      *-------MODIFIER MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 13060 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (2), IND (98)
              MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.
           IF NEW-KEYWORD  = SPACES
      *-------KEYWORD MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 11020 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (3), IND (98)
              MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.
           IF NEW-MODIFIER = SPACES
      *-------MODIFIER MUST BE ENTERED
              MOVE 13060 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
              PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (4), IND (98)
              MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
              PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
              PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
              GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

       63-VERIFY-OLD-KWM.
           MOVE OLD-KEYWORD  TO SEND-KW.
           MOVE OLD-MODIFIER TO SEND-MOD.

           CALL "CRFMTKWM" USING REFORMAT-KWM-AREA,
               BASE, VIEW-COMAREA.

           MOVE RETURN-KW  TO KEY-ARG.
           MOVE RETURN-MOD TO MOD-ARG.
           PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-I.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *--------KEYWORD/MODIFIER DOES NOT EXIST
               MOVE  11 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   4 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
               MOVE  ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (2), IND (98)
               MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
               PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE KWM-ARG    TO SAVE-OLD-KWM.

       63-VERIFY-NEW-KWM.
           MOVE NEW-KEYWORD  TO SEND-KW.
           MOVE NEW-MODIFIER TO SEND-MOD.

           CALL "CRFMTKWM" USING REFORMAT-KWM-AREA,
               BASE, VIEW-COMAREA.

           MOVE RETURN-KW  TO KEY-ARG.
           MOVE RETURN-MOD TO MOD-ARG.

           PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-I.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYADJ-KEYWORD-MOD
              PERFORM 999-WRITE-MKEYADJ-O.

           MOVE KWM-ARG    TO SAVE-NEW-KWM.

       63-CHECK-IF-SAME.
           IF SAVE-OLD-KWM = SAVE-NEW-KWM
      *--------OLD KWM AND NEW KWM ARE THE SAME
               MOVE  15 TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  12 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE
               MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (1), IND (2), IND (3), IND (4)
               MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98)
               MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC
               PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN
               PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN
               GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

       63-REPLACE-OLD.
           MOVE "Y" TO MKEYADJ-DELETE-FLAG.
           MOVE SAVE-OLD-KWM TO KWM-ARG.

           PERFORM 999-START-DCODE-O.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
              PERFORM 631-UPDATE-DCODE-AND-DESC.
           IF MKEYADJ-DELETE-FLAG = "Y"
              PERFORM 999-READ-MKEYADJ-O
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 999-DELETE-MKEYADJ-O.

      *----KEYWORD/MODIFIER HAS BEEN UPDATED WHERE ALLOWED.
           MOVE SPACES TO MOD-SCREEN.
           MOVE 11022 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO MOD-CMD-LINE.
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (98).
           MOVE MOD-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN.
           GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

       63-MODIFY-KWM-X.
           EXIT.

       631-UPDATE-DCODE-AND-DESC.

      *----REPLACE OLD KWM WITH NEW KWM IN DCODE AND (DDESC OR DDESC2).
      *----PROVIDED THAT THE OLD KWM IS NOT THE AMERICAN LANGUAGE KWM
      *----LINKED TO A CORPORATE CODE.

           MOVE "N" TO EOF-DCODE.

           PERFORM 6311-UPDATE-1-CODE THRU 6311-UPDATE-1-CODE-X
              UNTIL EOF-DCODE = "Y".

       6311-UPDATE-1-CODE.

           PERFORM 999-READ-NEXT-DCODE-O.

           IF CODE-KEYWORD-MOD NOT = KWM-ARG
              MOVE "Y" TO EOF-DCODE
              PERFORM 999-RESET-DCODE-O
              GO TO 6311-UPDATE-1-CODE-X.

           MOVE CODE-KEY-CODE       TO SAVE-CODE, CODE-CHK-IN.
           MOVE CODE-LANGUAGE-IND   TO SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PLANT-CODE TO PLANT-CHK.

           CALL "CCODECHK" USING CCODECHK-PARMS.

      *----DON'T MODIFY IF CODE IS A CORPORATE CODE AND KWM IS
      *----THE AMERICAN LANGUAGE (CORPORATE) KEYWORD/MODIFIER.

           IF CODE-IS-CORP-CODE
              IF ((SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND = "1"
                   AND MPLTINFO-DDESC-LANG = "001")

               OR (SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND = "2"
                   AND MPLTINFO-DDESC2-LANG = "001"))

                   MOVE "N" TO MKEYADJ-DELETE-FLAG
                   GO TO 6311-UPDATE-1-CODE-X.

           PERFORM 999-DELETE-DCODE-O.

           MOVE SPACES             TO BUF-DCODE.
           MOVE SAVE-CODE          TO CODE-KEY-CODE.
           MOVE SAVE-NEW-KWM       TO CODE-KEYWORD-MOD.
           MOVE SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND  TO CODE-LANGUAGE-IND.

           PERFORM 999-WRITE-DCODE-O.

           MOVE SAVE-CODE TO CODE-ARG.
           MOVE "00"      TO ID-ARG.

           IF SAVE-LANGUAGE-IND IS EQUAL TO "2"
               PERFORM 63111-UPDATE-DDESC2
           ELSE
               PERFORM 63112-UPDATE-DDESC.

       6311-UPDATE-1-CODE-X.
           EXIT.

       63111-UPDATE-DDESC2.

           PERFORM 999-READ-DDESC2-O.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "1ST REC IN DDESC2 IS NOT 00 IN 63111-UPDATE-DDESC2"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "CODE =   "     TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (1)
              MOVE DESC2-CORP-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (2)
              MOVE "REC ID = "     TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (3)
              MOVE DESC2-ID-NUM    TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (4)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SAVE-NEW-KWM TO DESC2-KWM.

           PERFORM 999-REWRITE-DDESC2-O.

       63112-UPDATE-DDESC.

           PERFORM 999-READ-DDESC-O.

           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "1ST REC IN DDESC IS NOT 00 IN 63112-UPDATE-DDESC"
                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "CODE =   "     TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (1)
              MOVE DESC2-CORP-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (2)
              MOVE "REC ID = "     TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (3)
              MOVE DESC2-ID-NUM    TO BU-DISPLAY-LINE (4)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SAVE-NEW-KWM TO DESC-KWM.

           PERFORM 999-REWRITE-DDESC-O.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       998-WRITE-SCREEN.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC  FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

       998-READ-SCREEN.
           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.

       998-AUTO-READ-SCREEN.
           READ  DISPLAY-FILE TERMINAL IS TERMINAL-ID
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                   NO DATA MOVE DISPLAY-STATUS TO DISPLAY-STATUS.
      *    MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE CATREAD-MSG-SET TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE CATREAD-MSG-NUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *---------------------------------
      * MKEYADJ
      *---------------------------------

      *-INPUT---------------------------

       999-READ-MKEYADJ-I.
           MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYWORDADJ OF MKEYADJ-REC-I.
           READ MKEYADJ-I INTO BUF-MKEYADJ
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "READ MKEYADJ-I:999-RMI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE KEY-ARG                  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE MOD-ARG                  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *-OUTPUT--------------------------

       999-READ-MKEYADJ-O.
           MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYWORDADJ OF MKEYADJ-REC-O.
           READ MKEYADJ-O INTO BUF-MKEYADJ
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "READ MKEYADJ-O:999-RMO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE KEY-ARG                  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE MOD-ARG                  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-WRITE-MKEYADJ-O.
           WRITE MKEYADJ-REC-O FROM BUF-MKEYADJ
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "WRITE MKEYADJ-O:999-WMO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE KEY-ARG                   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE MOD-ARG                   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-DELETE-MKEYADJ-O.
           DELETE MKEYADJ-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DELETE MKEYADJ-O:999-DMO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *---------------------------------
      * DCODE
      *---------------------------------

      *-INPUT---------------------------

       999-START-DCODE-I.
           MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-I.
           START DCODE-I KEY = KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-I
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DCODE-I:999-SDI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE KEY-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE MOD-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *-OUTPUT--------------------------

       999-START-DCODE-O.
           MOVE KWM-ARG TO KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-O.
           START DCODE-O KEY = KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DCODE-O:999-SDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE KEY-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE MOD-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-READ-NEXT-DCODE-O.
           READ DCODE-O NEXT INTO BUF-DCODE
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO EOF-DCODE.

       999-RESET-DCODE-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-O.
           START DCODE-O KEY > KEYWORDADJ OF DCODE-REC-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       999-WRITE-DCODE-O.
           WRITE DCODE-REC-O FROM BUF-DCODE
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "WRITE DCODE-O:999-WDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE KEY-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE MOD-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-DELETE-DCODE-O.
           DELETE DCODE-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DELETE DCODE-O:999-DDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE CODE-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *---------------------------------
      * DDESC
      *---------------------------------

       999-READ-DDESC-O.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE   OF DDESC-REC-O.
           MOVE ID-ARG   TO DESCIDNUM OF DDESC-REC-O.
           READ DDESC-O INTO BUF-DDESC
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "READ DDESC-O:999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CODE-ARG               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE ID-ARG                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-REWRITE-DDESC-O.
           REWRITE DDESC-REC-O FROM BUF-DDESC
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE DDESC-O:999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DESC2-CORP-CODE           TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE KEY-ARG                   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE MOD-ARG                   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *---------------------------------
      * DDESC2
      *---------------------------------

       999-READ-DDESC2-O.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE   OF DDESC2-REC-O.
           MOVE ID-ARG   TO DESCIDNUM OF DDESC2-REC-O.
           READ DDESC2-O INTO BUF-DDESC2
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "READ DDESC2-O:999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CODE-ARG                TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE ID-ARG                  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       999-REWRITE-DDESC2-O.
           REWRITE DDESC2-REC-O FROM BUF-DDESC2
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE DDESC2-O:999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DESC2-CORP-CODE            TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE KEY-ARG                    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE MOD-ARG                    TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
